### Translation for MeshSanityDiag
mesh-sanity-diag-empty-point-array = Empty set of points
mesh-sanity-diag-empty-mesh = Empty mesh
mesh-sanity-diag-null-cell-size = Cell size is null
mesh-sanity-diag-odd-connectivity-table-size = Connectivity table size ({$connectivity_table_len}) is not a multiple of cell size ({$point_per_cell})
mesh-sanity-diag-duplicated-node-in-cell = Duplicated node #{$point_idx} ({$coords}) in the same cell #{$cell_idx}
mesh-sanity-diag-points-too-close = Point #{$point_a_idx} ({$coords_a}) and point #{$point_b_idx} ({$coords_b}) are too closes: {$distance}
mesh-sanity-diag-connectivity-index-out-of-range = Connectivity index out-of-range: got point #{$point_idx} in cell #{$cell_idx} but there is only {$points_cnt}
